    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>A simple in-memory Bloom filter to reduce false lookups on index data.</para>
<para>Uses k independent hash functions derived from two base hashes (double hashing) to achieve a configurable false-positive rate. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
